{"version":1,"content":"<p>廣泛應用於網站和網絡應用開發的 PHP 編程語言正面臨一次緊急安全更新。PHP 開發團隊計劃於2026年10月21日發佈針對兩項嚴重安全漏洞的修復補丁。由於漏洞可能允許攻擊者在未經身份驗證的情況下遠程執行代碼，歐洲網絡安全機構已建議相關組織儘快完成修復；如果暫時無法更新，部分網站可能需要隔離網絡訪問，甚至暫時關閉服務，以降低遭到攻擊的風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583238.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.932923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:52:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"753ac6a7db539a24ff7c009ba24b1eafc1fc8d1828f1fa57dd0f07ac4d2a4d51","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}